Error [E0018]: changeable access is written `mut`, not `write`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_write.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | fn bump(write score: Int) {
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: Jet has exactly one spelling for each thing, so all code reads the same
 Fix: replace `write` with `mut`

Error [E0985]: `var` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_write.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     var x: Int = 1;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name @= value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name := value` instead of `var name = value`
